# Neither command needs a credential to read Google Skills or to serve the API.
# The settings below are read from the collector's process environment (for example a
# launchd or systemd job definition). All are optional.
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_SNAPSHOT_PATH=/srv/gemini-academy/snapshot.json
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_COLLECTOR_STATE=/srv/gemini-academy/collector
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_USER_AGENT=gemini-academy-api/0.1.0
# Cloudflare purge of one hostname after each publication. Set all three or none:
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_HOSTNAME=gemini-academy.deployedwork.com
# GEMINI_ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_PURGE_TOKEN_FILE=/srv/gemini-academy/cache-purge-token
